# Design system — calm, professional, eye-soothing

This is a consulting site, not a portfolio or tech demo. Every visual choice
should reinforce trust, clarity, and professionalism.

## Color tokens (Tailwind)

Defined in `tailwind.config.ts`. Never use ad-hoc hex codes outside these.

- `cream` `#FDFBF7` — primary page background. Use instead of pure white.
- `sand` `#F0EEEA` — secondary background, alternating section panels.
- `line` `#E2DFD9` — borders, dividers, hairlines.
- `ink` `#1E1E1E` — primary text. (Never pure `#000`.)
- `mute` `#5E5A55` — secondary text, captions, labels.
- `accent` `#3A6B5E` — single brand accent (teal). Only on:
  - primary CTA buttons,
  - one headline word per section (sparingly),
  - key icons and numbers,
  - the focus ring.
- `accent-dark` `#2E5448` — accent hover state.
- `accent-soft` `#E7EFEC` — accent tinted background for icon chips, selection.

### Forbidden

- Neon / fluorescent colors anywhere.
- Cyan-purple gradients.
- Any color outside the palette above without an explicit reason.
- `bg-gradient-to-*` other than the controlled CTA band.

## Typography

- Heading family: `Newsreader` (serif). Used via `font-heading` / `--font-heading`.
- Body family: `Inter`. Used via `font-sans` / default.
- Weights: 400 / 500 / 600 only.
- Allowed sizes (`fontSize` ramp in Tailwind): `xs sm base lg xl 2xl 3xl 4xl 5xl`.
- **Maximum three sizes per page**, including hero. Don’t introduce new sizes.
- Line lengths capped at `max-w-prose` (≈ 65ch) for paragraphs.

## Spacing & layout

- Base spacing unit: 4 px (Tailwind default — don’t override).
- Page max width: `max-w-content` (≈ 72rem / 1152 px). Never wider.
- Vertical section rhythm: `py-20 md:py-28`.
- Generous whitespace > dense layouts.
- Asymmetrical 12-col grids over rigid boxy grids when possible.
- Mobile first; everything must work down to a 320px viewport.

## Motion rules

- Allowed:
  - Fade-in on scroll, **once** (`whileInView` + `viewport={{ once: true }}`).
  - Hover scale up to `1.02` max.
  - Color / shadow transitions ≤ 200 ms.
- Forbidden:
  - Auto-rotating, spinning, parallax, flying, flashing.
  - Letter-by-letter stagger / typewriter.
  - Carousels, sliders, marquees.
  - Particle backgrounds, canvas / WebGL animations, custom cursors.
  - `animation-iteration-count: infinite` of any kind.
- Always respect `prefers-reduced-motion: reduce`. The global CSS already
  zeroes durations under that media query — don’t fight it.

## Components

- `card` (`.card`): white background, 1px `line` border, `rounded-2xl`. No
  glassmorphism, no `backdrop-blur` on content cards.
- `card-soft`: same shape, `sand` background. Use for stat tiles inside `sand`
  sections to keep contrast.
- `Button`: three variants — `primary` (filled accent), `secondary` (outline),
  `ghost`. Never invent a fourth.
- Icons: `lucide-react` only. `strokeWidth={1.6}` for restrained line weight.
  Never emojis-as-icons.

## Imagery

- No stock photo gradients, no AI-generated faces.
- Future real photography (team, office) should be muted, warm, low-saturation.
- Below-the-fold media must be lazy-loaded.
- Keep `next/image` `unoptimized: true` — site is static-exported.
